    "date_str": "2025-10-20",
    "description": "What is new, concerning, and indeed grotesque, is the opposition\u2019s willingness to stand shoulder-to-shoulder with the Rajapaksas in defence of democracy, basic rights, and rule of law.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=86513",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1760954400.0,
    "chunk_id": "2025-10-20-dbsjeyarajcom-4ff558e4-0000",
