    "chunk_text": "Pan Asia Bank expands digital payment solutions through new strategic partnership\n\nPan Asia Bank, has taken another step forward in strengthening its digital banking capabilities by signing a strategic agreement with WEBXPAY to provide seamless, secure, and innovative payment solutions to its customers and merchant base.\n\nThis partnership is designed to accelerate financial inclusion and provide greater support for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) across the country. Merchants will now have access to an expanded range of online and in-store payment facilities, enabling them to accept card payments, QR codes, installment facilities, and multi-currency transactions with ease.\n\nSpeaking on the occasion, Naleen Edirisinghe Director/CEO of Pan Asia Bank said \u201cOur goal is to make digital financial services more inclusive, convenient, and future-ready. By collaborating with a strong fintech partner, we can provide businesses with tools to expand, thrive, and deliver greater value to their customers.\u201d\n\nSHAPE-Asia: Hand in hand for healthier diets and lasting change worldwide\n\nAitken Spence partners with Sri Lanka Air Force on \u201cClean Today \u2013 Green Tomorrow\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
