    "description": "US Dollar\u2019s collapse, rise of Bitcoin and the run of gold",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/US-Dollar-s-collapse-rise-of-Bitcoin-and-the-run-of-gold/4-783201",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
