    "description": "Teaching Sri Lanka\u2019s 2009 UNHRC Geneva Win: The Barcelona Lecture",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/teaching-sri-lankas-2009-unhrc-geneva-win-the-barcelona-lecture/",
