    "chunk_text": "Dialog e-Load Super Blast hands over second Toyota Raize SUV to winner in Kandy\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, has further strengthened its drive toward digital empowerment by awarding the second Toyota Raize SUV grand prize and marking a major milestone of over one million winners through its ongoing \u201cDialog e-Load Super Blast\u201d rewards campaign. The initiative continues to encourage Sri Lankans to embrace digital reloads as the smarter, faster, and more rewarding way to stay connected.\n\nThe second grand prize draw took place on 18th October during the vibrant \u201cSiyatha Tharu Piree Ra with Dialog e-Load Super Blast\u201d live TV show, where S. M. R. P. B. Sakalasooriya from Kandy drove away in a brand-new Toyota Raize SUV. With one more draw scheduled for December, the campaign continues to transform the digital reload experience islandwide \u2014 combining convenience, excitement, and life-changing rewards.\n\nAberdeen Holdings\u2019 Snehadhana Foundation expands its outreach with the launch of the School Meal Support Project\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
