    "description": "Keells and Uber Eats partner to bring on-demand grocery delivery to Sri Lankan homes",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/keells-and-uber-eats-partner-to-bring-on-demand-grocery-delivery-to-sri-lankan-homes/",
    "lang": "en",
