    "description": "Dr. Dulan Hettiarachchi honoured with prestigious \u201cPride of Nation\u201d international award",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Dr-Dulan-Hettiarachchi-honoured-with-prestigious-Pride-of-Nation-international-award/34-783354",
    "lang": "en",
