    "description": "Sectoral Oversight Committee reviews 2025 Budget progress of key ministries",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sectoral-Oversight-Committee-reviews-2025-Budget-progress-of-key-ministries/56-783409",
    "lang": "en",
