    "description": "Muslim MPs urge immediate release of detained Tamil translation of Holy Qur\u2019an consignment",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Muslim-MPs-urge-immediate-release-of-detained-Tamil-translation-of-Holy-Qur-an-consignment/56-783442",
    "lang": "en",
