    "description": "In the current global context, it is essential that the Government and private sector organizations such as the CNCI work together to strengthen local industries \u2013 PM",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/in-the-current-global-context-it-is-essential-that-the-government-and-private-sector-organizations-such-as-the-cnci-work-together-to-strengthen-local-industries-pm/",
