    "chunk_size_bytes": 1938,
    "chunk_text": "Deen Brothers bags double Gold at FCCISL Entrepreneur of the Year 2025\n\nDeen Brothers Imports (Pvt) Ltd, one of Sri Lanka\u2019s most trusted importers of agricultural, industrial, mechanical, technical tools and electric appliances, emerged as a double Gold winner at the prestigious Entrepreneur of the Year Awards 2025, organized by the Federation of Chambers of Commerce and Industry of Sri Lanka (FCCISL). At this year\u2019s ceremony, DBL achieved two of the highest accolades: Southern Province \u2013 Extra Large Gold Award and National Level \u2013 Extra Large Gold Award.\n\nThis remarkable recognition further strengthens Deen Brothers\u2019 reputation as an industry leader with a robust distribution network covering Sri Lanka and the Maldives. The company continues to represent globally acclaimed brands including Oregon, Dongcheng, Shimge, Briggs & Stratton, Toptul, Golden Bridge, and Norton. Under the trusted DBL brand, the company markets agricultural, industrial, carpentry and construction tools, power tools, generators, hardware, spare parts, and household electrical appliances, all backed with comprehensive warranties and exceptional after-sales service. Reflecting on this success, Dr. M. N. M. Najeeb Deen, Managing Director of Deen Brothers Imports (Pvt) Ltd, stated: \u201cOur philosophy has always been to provide the right tools with responsibility and deliver the best quality equipment to our customers. Receiving these two Gold awards at national and provincial levels in 2025 is a moment of immense pride for all of us at Deen Brothers.\u201d\n\nManjula Ariyakumara of Three Sinha Industries wins Gold at Sri Lankan Entrepreneur of the Year Awards\n\nSolar Care International honoured for solar PV preventive maintenance and innovation\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
