    "description": "Indian nabbed at BIA with heroin worth Rs. 85 m",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Indian-nabbed-at-BIA-with-heroin-worth-Rs-85-m/56-783521",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1761609535.0,
