    "description": "From \u201cNo Kings\u201d to \u201cNo Clients\u201d: Political and economic gravity \u2013 Part 1",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-No-Kings-to-No-Clients-Political-and-economic-gravity-Part-1/4-783527",
    "lang": "en",
