    "description": "Public Health Is Held Hostage: A Mount Lavinia Family\u2019s Plea For Sanity In Waste Management, Fallen On Deaf Ears",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/public-health-is-held-hostage-a-mount-lavinia-familys-plea-for-sanity-in-waste-management-fallen-on-deaf-ears/",
    "lang": "en",
