    "description": "Daraz Sri Lanka and Industry Ministry join to empower SMEs growth",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Daraz-Sri-Lanka-and-Industry-Ministry-join-to-empower-SMEs-growth/34-783578",
    "lang": "en",
