    "description": "DFCC Bank\u2019s Lanka Money Transfer platform wins Silver at NBQSA 2025 for advancing financial inclusion",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/dfcc-banks-lanka-money-transfer-platform-wins-silver-at-nbqsa-2025-for-advancing-financial-inclusion/",
