    "chunk_text": "JXG \u2013 DHACK empowers young innovators for second consecutive year\n\nJXG (Janashakthi Group) will return as the title sponsor for DHACK 2025 for the second consecutive year, reaffirming its commitment to fostering innovation and creative problem-solving among emerging tech talent. Organized by the Student Association of Information Technology at the University of Sri Jayewardenepura, the event is scheduled for 1st November 2025, from 9.00 a.m. to 5.00 p.m. at the University.\n\nThis year\u2019s competition will feature seven finalists presenting their UI/UX prototypes to a panel of judges, showcasing creative solutions to real-world challenges through thoughtful design and practical execution. The event will conclude with an awards ceremony recognizing the most impactful and outstanding innovations.\n\nMorison\u2019s Paracetol champions child safety at Swarnavahini Children\u2019s Day celebrations\n\nSri Lankan Realtor in the U.S. named among top 1.5% real estate professionals nationwide\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
