    "description": "Evolution of UNHRC resolutions on Sri Lanka: From sovereignty to accountability",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Evolution-of-UNHRC-resolutions-on-Sri-Lanka-From-sovereignty-to-accountability/4-783638",
