    "chunk_text": "Menaka Athukorala joins Alpha Fire as new Chairman\n\nAlpha Fire Services PLC has appointed Menaka Athukorala to its Board as Non-Executive Chairman.\n\nThe company said he is a dynamic and results-driven executive with over 30 years of experience in plantation management, renewable energy, and corporate leadership with proven expertise in strategic planning, operational management, and driving sustainable business growth.\n\nHe holds an MBA and a Higher National Diploma in Plantation Management and Agriculture."
