    "description": "New road safety, driver drug-testing laws to be tabled in Parliament",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/New-road-safety-driver-drug-testing-laws-to-be-tabled-in-Parliament/56-783666",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
