    "chunk_size_bytes": 578,
    "chunk_text": "Lawyer arrested for aiding \u2018Ganemulla Sanjeewa\u2019 murder suspect\n\nPolice have arrested a female lawyer on charges of aiding and abetting the murder of underworld figure \u2018Ganemulla Sanjeewa\u2019.\n\nPolice said the suspect, who is a practicing Attorney-at-Law, is accused of assisting Ishara Sewwandi, a key suspect in the killing by providing her with a forged lawyer\u2019s identity card, the copy of the Penal Code with the pistol concealed inside to the shooter.\n\nInvestigations revealed that the fake ID was used to mislead authorities and facilitate the suspect\u2019s movements."
