    "description": "Govt. to address challenges in releasing military-held lands in Jaffna-Palaly area",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Govt-to-address-challenges-in-releasing-military-held-lands-in-Jaffna-Palaly-area/56-783668",
    "lang": "en",
