    "date_str": "2025-10-31",
    "description": "Proposal for establishment of Advisory Board for revival of welding technology",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Proposal-for-establishment-of-Advisory-Board-for-revival-of-welding-technology/4-783702",
