    "description": "Why some countries prosper, whilst others continue to remain poor and in chaos",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Why-some-countries-prosper-whilst-others-continue-to-remain-poor-and-in-chaos/4-783703",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
