    "chunk_text": "The Minister highlighted that modern technology will be increasingly integrated into healthcare, disclosing plans to introduce a citizens\u2019 e-Health service to enhance patient care and record management.\n\nThe recruitment process had been suspended since 2021 due to delays in Treasury approval and has now resumed after four years. Appointed graduates must report to their respective Nursing Colleges on 6 November, before being assigned to 31 hospitals for practical training."
