    "chunk_size_bytes": 1473,
    "chunk_text": "Emojot hosts Bradford Smith for CX transformation\n\nIn September 2025, Emojot, a leader in AI-powered Experience Management, hosted two exclusive executive forums in Colombo, featuring globally recognized CX authority Bradford Smith. The event aimed to accelerate customer experience transformation for top Sri Lankan executives from sectors like hospitality, healthcare, retail, and finance.\n\nSmith presented high-level, actionable insights on leveraging CX to directly drive profitability, loyalty, and long-term brand value. He emphasized that each customer interaction is a critical \u201cmoment of truth,\u201d where winning experiences are defined by simplicity, empathy, and design-led thinking.\n\nThe forums were designed to foster deep collaboration, moving beyond theory to practical application.\n\nThe event\u2019s success underscored the readiness of Sri Lankan enterprises to embrace this CX future and reaffirmed Emojot\u2019s mission to empower organizations. As summarized by Emojot CEO Dr. Shahani Markus, the initiative was about uniting leaders to explore \u201chow AI can make that emotional connection stronger, smarter, and more human.\u201d\n\nRakuten Symphony and SLT-MOBITEL partner for open RAN trial in Sri Lanka\n\nPussalla wins National Gold Award at CNCI Achiever Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
