    "chunk_size_bytes": 1614,
    "chunk_text": "Pussalla wins National Gold Award at CNCI Achiever Awards 2025\n\nPussalla Meat Producers (Pvt) Ltd was honoured with the National Gold Award in the Extra-Large Manufacturing Category and recognised among the Top Ten Extra-Large Companies at the CNCI Achiever Awards 2025, organized by the Ceylon National Chamber of Industries (CNCI).\n\nAs a fully vertically integrated Poultry Company in Sri Lanka, managing operations from grandparent farms to consumer retail, Pussalla continues to embody its long-term vision of self-sufficiency, uncompromised food safety, and sustainable growth.\n\nThe model also allows Pussalla to minimize dependency on external suppliers, strengthen biosecurity, and maintain stable quality across its island-wide operations.\n\nPussalla stood out across these criteria, demonstrating exceptional operational discipline and long-term planning. The company\u2019s self-sufficient production model and rigorous internal quality assurance system have become benchmarks for the Sri Lankan poultry industry.\n\nChairman Philip J. Wewita described the CNCI recognition as \u201ca validation of our vision, mission, and values.\u201d Further stated that \u201cnoting that Pussalla\u2019s success was not the result of an easy journey, but rather the outcome of unwavering commitment, dedication, and persistence demonstrated by every member of the team.\u201d\n\nJanashakthi Finance posts strong H1 growth with profits surging 22%\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
